Interactability_Text_Line_2 BIA Reports Government Corruption
Interactability_Text_Line_3 A report released by the Brazilian Intelligence Agency (BIA) suggests more than half of Coalition aid destined for small settlements in Brazil never arrives at its intended destination due to corruption alone.